// Invaders that bomb back: left and right move the cannon, space (or Fire) shoots; the gray
// shields stop shots and bombs; a bomb on the cannon costs one of 3 lives.
// icon: fill 6 3 18 3 18 10 6 10 line 4 13 8 9 line 20 13 16 9 fill 9 17 15 17 15 21 9 21
state ix = [0; 6];              // the invaders: column, row, and whether each is alive
